        "Create a photorealistic character turnaround reference sheet of the same real person from the user reference photo (image2).\n\nUse the character sheet image (image1) ONLY as layout and pose guide: three vertical columns with clean separation.\nColumn 1: front view full body.\nColumn 2: left profile full body, character facing left.\nColumn 3: back view full body.\n\nPreserve exact facial identity, skin tone, hairstyle, and body proportions from the user photo. Match body measurements from the persona parameters below.\n\nPlain studio background, soft neutral lighting, DSLR photorealistic look, muted cinematic tones, thin subtle borders, even spacing, consistent scale and alignment. No text, no logos, no watermarks."
